<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Toetsing speelt een centrale rol in onderwijs: het helpt richting geven aan het leren, maakt zichtbaar of leeruitkomsten zijn behaald en is vaak nodig voor het verkrijgen van studiepunten of diploma’s. In transdisciplinair</span><span style="margin: 0px"> onderwijs brengt toetsing echter extra uitdagingen met zich mee, omdat het leren in hoge mate onvoorspelbaar, persoonsgebonden en contextueel is.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Er is nog weinig empirisch onderzoek naar toetsing en beoordeling in transdisciplinair</span><span style="margin: 0px"> onderwijs (Swanenberg</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">, 2024). Wel is duidelijk: </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">context is leidend</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">. Sluit daarom altijd aan bij de leeruitkomsten en leeractiviteiten in jouw specifieke onderwijspraktijk – er is geen gouden standaard, wél een zorgvuldige afweging. Het is belangrijk stil te staan bij vier fundamentele vragen: </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">wie</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> toetst, </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">waartoe</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> toetsing dient, </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">wat</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> je toetst en </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">hoe</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> je dit vormgeeft.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Wie is betrokken bij de toetsing?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Transdisciplinair onderwijs is gestoeld op gelijkwaardige samenwerking tussen studenten, docenten, praktijkpartners en soms ook burgers. Toch is toetsing in het hoger onderwijs primair gericht op studenten. Deze asymmetrie – alleen de student wordt beoordeeld – kan botsen met het streven naar gelijkwaardigheid in samenwerking. Hoewel hierover nog weinig onderzoek beschikbaar is, is het van belang om in je ontwerp bewust na te denken over de implicaties van toetsing op de onderlinge verhoudingen (Meyer et al., 2025</span><span style="margin: 0px">) .</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Waartoe toetst je?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">In plaats van uniforme leerdoelen voor alle studenten, draait transdisciplinair</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> leren vaak om </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">persoonlijke, professionele en identiteitsontwikkeling</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">. Studenten brengen hun eigen kennis, ervaringen en leerbehoeften in. Toetsing zou dus ruimte moeten bieden aan diversiteit: het moet studenten uitdagen om zich te ontwikkelen, in plaats van hen te beperken. Dit vraagt om toetsing </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">om te leren</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> (in plaats van toetsing als eindstation) en een benadering die ook verschillen tussen studenten waardeert (‘assessment <span style="margin: 0px">for</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> <span style="margin: 0px">distinctiveness</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">’) (<span style="margin: 0px">Jorre</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> de St <span style="margin: 0px">Jorre</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> &amp; Oliver, 2018).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Wat toets je in transdisciplinair</span><span style="margin: 0px"> onderwijs?</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Leeruitkomsten in transdisciplinair</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> onderwijs gaan vaak over integratie van perspectieven, omgaan met complexiteit, reflectie en samenwerking. Zulke leeruitkomsten zijn niet eenduidig, en kennen vaak </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">leer-verrassingen </span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">(Baggen et al. 2022; <span style="margin: 0px">Gulikers</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> &amp; Oonk, 2019). Het is daarom belangrijk om samen met studenten en betrokkenen duidelijkheid te creëren over wat als waardevol resultaat wordt gezien – zowel op inhoudelijk als op procesniveau.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Drie mogelijke toetsingsdomeinen:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><ol style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Maatschappelijke prestatie</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> – bijdrage aan het vraagstuk of de praktijk</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Verantwoording van het proces</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> – hoe tot dit resultaat gekomen is</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Persoonlijke ontwikkeling</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> – groei in samenwerking, reflectie en rolbewustzijn</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ol><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Hoe toets je?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Om aan te sluiten bij het leerproces in transdisciplinair</span><span style="margin: 0px"> onderwijs, is een variëteit aan toetsvormen</span><span style="margin: 0px"> nodig (Meyer et al., 2025). Daarbij kun je denken aan:</span>&nbsp;</span></p><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Productgerichte toetsing</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> – reflecteert de inhoudelijke en praktische opbrengst (bijvoorbeeld een advies, prototype of interventie)</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Procesgerichte toetsing</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> – maakt ontwikkeling van vaardigheden, houding en samenwerking zichtbaar</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 24px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Tip</span><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">: Dit artikel</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"> </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">laat zien hoe studenten </span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">zelf ontworpen</span> opdrachten (</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Student-<span style="margin: 0px">Devised</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> Assessments</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">) in interdisciplinaire modules, de manier waarop we leren en beoordelen radicaal kunnen veranderen.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;" lang="NL-NL">Bronnen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px;">Baggen, Y., Lans, T., &amp; Gulikers, J. (2022). Making entrepreneurship education available to all: Design principles for educational programs stimulating an entrepreneurial mindset. Entrepreneurship Education and Pedagogy, 5(3), 347-374.</span><span style="font-size: 12px;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;" lang="EN-US">Gulikers, J., &amp; Oonk, C. (2019). Towards a rubric for stimulating and evaluating sustainable learning. Sustainability, 11(4), 969.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px;">Jorre de St Jorre, T., &amp; Oliver, B. (2018). Want students to engage? Contextualise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> graduate learning outcomes and assess for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> employability. Higher Education Research &amp; Development, 37(1), 44-57.</span><span style="font-size: 12px;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px;">Meyer, H., Riva, E., Logan, F. et al. Humanising</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px;"> higher education through interdisciplinary student-devised assessments. Humanit</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;" lang="EN-US"> Soc Sci Commun 12, 1196 (2025). </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"></span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://doi.org/10.1057/s41599-025-05513-4"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">https://doi.org/10.1057/s41599-025-05513-4</span></span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></body>
</html>